{"applicationId":"fd6a396e6d214afc8e72ed508724e213","applicationName":"中交路南-出差考勤管理","content":"(function () {\r\n    (function () {\r\n        //获取当前用户\r\n        var user = $.context.getCurrentUserId();\r\n        //应用Id\r\n        var applicationId = $.context.getCurrentApplicationId();\r\n\r\n        //获取本月度\r\n        var now = $.date.getCurrentDate();        //当前日期       \r\n        var nowMonth = now.getMonth();           //当前月     \r\n        var nowYear = now.getYear() + 1900;\r\n        var mongthdays = getMonthDays(nowYear, nowMonth);//本月天数\r\n\r\n        // var monthstartdate = getMonthStartDate(nowYear, nowMonth);  //本月起始日期\r\n        // var monthEndDate = getMonthEndDate(nowYear, nowMonth, mongthdays);//本月结束日期\r\n        var yearstartdate = new Date(nowYear, 0, 1);   //本年第一天\r\n        var yearenddate = new Date(nowYear, 11, 31);  //本年最后一天\r\n\r\n        var date = yearstartdate.getTime();\r\n        var date1 = yearenddate.getTime();\r\n\r\n        //表单名称\r\n        var formName1 = \"员工信息维护\";\r\n        //控件值键对\r\n        var filterParamList1 = new Packages.java.util.ArrayList();\r\n        // var filterParam1 = new Packages.cn.com.do1.do1cloud.runtime.dto.FilterParam(\"姓名\", \"eq\", user);\r\n        // var filterParam2 = new Packages.cn.com.do1.do1cloud.runtime.dto.FilterParam(\"休假类型\", \"eq\", \"1\");//\r\n        var filterParam3 = new Packages.cn.com.do1.do1cloud.runtime.dto.FilterParam(\"申请日期\", \"ge\", date);//大于等于\r\n        var filterParam4 = new Packages.cn.com.do1.do1cloud.runtime.dto.FilterParam(\"申请日期\", \"lt\", date1);//小于\r\n        // filterParamList1.add(filterParam1);\r\n        // filterParamList.add(filterParam2);\r\n        filterParamList1.add(filterParam3);\r\n        filterParamList1.add(filterParam4);\r\n        var docS1 = $.form.getDocumentsByFilterParam(applicationId, formName1, filterParamList1);\r\n        num = 0;\r\n        if (docS1 != null && docS1.size() > 0) {\r\n            var kexiu = docS1.get(0).getElementByName(\"可休年假\").getValue();\r\n\r\n            docS1.get(0).addElement(\"已休年假\", String(num));\r\n            docS1.get(0).addElement(\"剩余年假\", String(kexiu - String(num)));\r\n            // $.message.sendGeneralStationMessage(\"111\", age, $.context.getCurrentUserId());\r\n            $.form.saveFormDocument(docS1.get(0), applicationId);\r\n        }\r\n\r\n    })()\r\n    //获得本月的开始日期     \r\n    function getMonthStartDate(nowYear, nowMonth) {\r\n        var monthStartDate0 = new Date(nowYear, nowMonth, 1);\r\n        //转格式\r\n        var format = \"yyyy-MM-dd\";\r\n        //获取日期字符串\r\n        var dateStr = $.date.dateToString(monthStartDate0, format);\r\n        var monthStartDate = $.date.stringToDate(dateStr, format)\r\n        return monthStartDate;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    //获得本月的结束日期     \r\n    function getMonthEndDate(nowYear, nowMonth, mongthdays) {\r\n        var monthEndDate0 = new Date(nowYear, nowMonth, mongthdays);\r\n        //转格式\r\n        var format = \"yyyy-MM-dd\";\r\n        //获取日期字符串\r\n        var dateStr = $.date.dateToString(monthEndDate0, format);\r\n        var monthEndDate = $.date.stringToDate(dateStr, format)\r\n        return monthEndDate;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    //获取本月总共天数\r\n    function getMonthDays(nowYear, nowMonth) {\r\n\r\n        var endday = new Date(nowYear, nowMonth + 1, 0);\r\n\r\n        return endday.getDate();\r\n\r\n    }\r\n})()","createTime":1765854149000,"createUserId":"1889706623013949441","customJsId":"","definitionId":"","hiddenCode":"03dd6857a7c14e4380e45fa1057cb2a2","id":"e178f49b534a4c8b8f66c1b4dc4dde7a","modelCode":"","modelId":"acc319a2309640c3a6fec8b6fd4b8620","modelType":"SCHEDULER_DESIGN","namespace":"cd","path":"年假重置","status":"NORMAL","tenantId":"9134167922923ba09ad18872b2b1246e","updateTime":1765854149000,"versions":0.0}